    conclusion:'Outside Prague, the Czech Republic\'s international families have been asked to choose between a commute, a compromise, and a boarding school. A serious virtual school ends that choice: live Cambridge, IB, or American curriculum in Brno, Ostrava, Plzen, Olomouc, and Mlada Boleslav, the dual-track years planned honestly, the age-15 transition used deliberately, and exams organised as trips rather than lifestyles. Book an assessment for your child, or start with our Czech Republic hub and city pages.',
